WEBVTT

00:41.667 --> 00:44.836
<i>On the brink between Heaven and Hell
lies the town of Daten City</i>

00:44.837 --> 00:49.300
<i>where horrible, evil spirits threaten
the humans' peace on a daily basis.</i>

00:50.593 --> 00:55.013
<i>The darkness lodged in people's hearts
secretly consumes this town.</i>

00:55.014 --> 00:58.099
<i>But there are some who wield light
beyond human understanding</i>

00:58.100 --> 01:01.479
<i>to eradicate these evil spirits,
these coalescences of people's desires.</i>

01:02.188 --> 01:04.481
<i>Who was given the duty
of driving away this darkness?</i>

01:04.482 --> 01:07.901
<i>Servants of God? Or minions of the Devil?</i>

01:07.902 --> 01:10.236
<i>Or is it both?</i>

01:10.237 --> 01:12.906
Chuck, chuck, chuck, chuck, chuck.
Chuck, chuck.

01:12.907 --> 01:15.451
Chuck, chuck, chuck. Chuck, chuck. Chuck!

01:24.668 --> 01:25.795
What's going on?

01:29.840 --> 01:31.674
Good morning, Panty.

01:31.675 --> 01:33.719
- Catch ya later, big boy.
- Always a pleasure!

01:35.513 --> 01:37.681
Good morning, Stocking.

01:41.227 --> 01:45.146
Heaven has blessed us with another
gracious message today! Listen up!

01:45.147 --> 01:49.067
Seriously? This crap again?
It's getting old.

01:49.068 --> 01:51.987
What's this? There's only half.
Makes no sense.

01:56.826 --> 01:57.827
Fas?

01:59.411 --> 02:00.912
Fas? Fas?

02:00.913 --> 02:02.957
Fas!

02:03.916 --> 02:04.917
Fas!

02:10.548 --> 02:12.590
Hey, is that the other half
to this bit of paper?

02:12.591 --> 02:14.969
Water and oil? The hell is this?

02:15.594 --> 02:19.014
It's a gracious message from Hell!

02:21.141 --> 02:23.226
Why are the demons here again?

02:23.227 --> 02:24.435
Forgot. Not my problem.

02:24.436 --> 02:26.063
Good morning, Scanty.

02:26.981 --> 02:29.190
To reside in the sanctuary of our most
reviled adversaries, the angels...

02:29.191 --> 02:30.775
What an unspeakable humiliation.

02:30.776 --> 02:33.194
But we shall not falter! For restraint
is the highest virtue decreed by our...

02:33.195 --> 02:34.904
<i>sacred rule!</i>

02:34.905 --> 02:36.906
Good morning, Kneesocks.

02:36.907 --> 02:38.992
We do not grovel for mercy
in enemy territory.

02:38.993 --> 02:43.830
Instead, we execute our housekeeping
duties with flawless precision...

02:43.831 --> 02:45.540
<i>for this is the essence of our pride!</i>

02:45.541 --> 02:47.166
<i>We are demon...</i>

02:47.167 --> 02:50.129
<i>high-class house maidens!</i>

02:50.754 --> 02:52.088
So basically, you're just freeloaders.

02:52.089 --> 02:53.965
Freeloaders? How lame.

02:53.966 --> 02:56.217
You there!
Do not scatter cake crumbs on the sofa!

02:56.218 --> 02:58.803
Leaving used condoms lying around is
absolutely unacceptable!

02:58.804 --> 03:00.346
- Sterilize! Sterilize!
- Fuck off!

03:00.347 --> 03:01.431
Hey, listen up!

03:01.432 --> 03:04.100
- You holy hoes and hell-bound bitches!
- Huh?

03:04.101 --> 03:07.979
Our God-given duty is to bust them goddamn
ghosts and maintain peace on Earth!

03:07.980 --> 03:10.774
Hm, your definition of peace
seems to differ from ours.

03:11.358 --> 03:14.319
<i>Real talk... I got a call
from the King of Hell himself.</i>

03:14.320 --> 03:17.031
<i>- The King of Hell?
- From Father, you say?</i>

03:17.531 --> 03:19.991
That damn Hell's Gate incident caused
a ghost exodus,

03:19.992 --> 03:23.953
and now His Evil Ass Majesty wants
to stop his workforce from quitting.

03:23.954 --> 03:26.915
More ghosts, less ghosts.
Demons have got it tough too, huh?

03:26.916 --> 03:29.959
Hell's defense capabilities have
significantly deteriorated ever since.

03:29.960 --> 03:32.503
This is a grave issue
that directly concerns national security.

03:32.504 --> 03:35.757
So you Demon Sisters are on cleanup duty!

03:35.758 --> 03:39.886
No goin' back to Hell till
all them runaway ghosts are rounded up!

03:39.887 --> 03:44.182
The King himself personally requested
this church be your home base.

03:44.183 --> 03:47.894
Why are we the ones being banned?
This outrage started with Corset, not us!

03:47.895 --> 03:50.605
Garter! Why the hell are you bartering
with demons now?

03:50.606 --> 03:52.482
Shut the hell up,
you freeloadin' sacks of crap!

03:52.483 --> 03:54.692
Your damn mission ain't
chasin' dudes, hoardin' sweets,

03:54.693 --> 03:56.152
or being a used rubber janitor!

03:56.153 --> 03:58.237
It's to collect these coins.

03:58.238 --> 03:59.906
Whoa, look at all those.

03:59.907 --> 04:02.158
Shouldn't these be enough
to get into Heaven already?

04:02.159 --> 04:03.242
Here's the deal.

04:03.243 --> 04:08.331
Daten City Heaven Coins have been tanking
on the Heavenly Stock Exchange

04:08.332 --> 04:10.083
thanks to that damn ghost pandemonium.

04:10.084 --> 04:11.627
Seriously? Then they're trash.

04:12.962 --> 04:13.962
Chuck?

04:13.963 --> 04:15.046
At this sorry-ass pace,

04:15.047 --> 04:18.132
you angels ain't gettin' back to Heaven
anytime this damn century!

04:18.133 --> 04:20.219
Oh dear... How terribly unfortunate.

04:21.637 --> 04:26.057
You two are in the same boat. Ain't y'all
got somethin' called Hell Coins?

04:26.058 --> 04:27.225
Yes we do.

04:27.226 --> 04:28.393
Listen up, you demon bitches!

04:28.394 --> 04:30.937
You are also to defeat ghosts
to stack up those coins, ya hear?

04:30.938 --> 04:35.274
Fill up the damn case, and maybe
you'll earn your ticket back to Hell!

04:35.275 --> 04:37.402
Which means we all look for ghosts,

04:37.403 --> 04:40.406
and whoever kills them first
gets to the coins.

04:41.073 --> 04:43.324
If that's the new rule...

04:43.325 --> 04:45.035
...then we must follow.

04:53.168 --> 04:54.794
<i>Chuck.</i>

04:54.795 --> 04:56.505
<i>Fas.</i>

04:59.675 --> 05:01.719
Fine, whatever.
Let's get this shit started.

05:06.098 --> 05:07.807
- Stocking.
- Panty.

05:07.808 --> 05:09.684
- Kneesocks.
- Sister.

05:09.685 --> 05:10.769
Let's roll.

05:17.985 --> 05:19.194
Whoo-hoo!

05:32.583 --> 05:35.209
The first one to find the ghost wins!

05:35.210 --> 05:37.754
Shut up. What was it? Ass and anal?

05:37.755 --> 05:38.880
Water and oil.

05:38.881 --> 05:41.215
Yeah right. And where the hell is
that ghost supposed to be?

05:41.216 --> 05:42.884
I found it, Sister.

05:42.885 --> 05:44.343
No way! What the hell is that?

05:44.344 --> 05:48.139
Everyone in Hell knows if you want to find
a ghost, you use a Ghost Detection App.

05:48.140 --> 05:49.265
That's unfair!

05:49.266 --> 05:52.101
<i>Turn right two blocks
past the weed dispensary,</i>

05:52.102 --> 05:53.603
<i>then left at the next weed store.</i>

05:53.604 --> 05:55.521
<i>Then turn left at the next dispensary,</i>

05:55.522 --> 05:58.609
<i>and then it's at a diner
next to another weed shop.</i>

05:59.234 --> 06:01.820
Very well. Let's proceed at once!

06:02.571 --> 06:04.489
Shit! We're going too!

06:04.490 --> 06:06.867
Go, See Through, go!

06:12.623 --> 06:17.044
Thanks for waiting.
Here's your beef cheese pancakes-- Whoa!

06:20.047 --> 06:22.507
You're telling me there's a ghost
in this crusty-ass shop?

06:22.508 --> 06:24.467
It smells like cheap oil.

06:24.468 --> 06:26.385
P-Panty! Guys!

06:26.386 --> 06:29.055
Yo, Geek Boy. The hell are you doing here?

06:29.056 --> 06:31.557
I-I actually work here.

06:31.558 --> 06:33.227
D-Did you... maybe come to see me?

06:37.606 --> 06:39.816
You sure this is the place?

06:39.817 --> 06:44.278
The app was just updated this morning. All
bugs should have been properly addressed.

06:44.279 --> 06:47.490
However...
We still don't know who the ghost is.

06:47.491 --> 06:49.367
What a fuckin' joke of an app.

06:49.368 --> 06:53.831
Our diner is famous for its p-pancakes.
Wanna have a bite?

06:54.540 --> 06:58.084
A-about that time I saved you the other
day, there's no need to thank me.

06:58.085 --> 07:00.295
I just did what any friend--
I mean any man would do--

07:01.588 --> 07:03.840
Ow! That kinda tickled.

07:03.841 --> 07:05.424
Nope. He's not the ghost.

07:05.425 --> 07:06.884
That was a human reaction.

07:06.885 --> 07:11.681
Hey, so like... Heavenly weapons can
kill ghosts but not humans, yeah?

07:11.682 --> 07:14.016
Is it the same for your shitty
demon-ass weapons?

07:14.017 --> 07:16.853
Ouch! Ow, hey now...

07:16.854 --> 07:20.940
It's true... our weapons fail
against mere humans.

07:20.941 --> 07:24.986
But angels?
You foul creatures are still fair game!

07:24.987 --> 07:27.364
Yeah? Same deal for you!

07:28.782 --> 07:31.909
How about we start shooting
everyone in this dump?

07:31.910 --> 07:34.412
We'll figure out who the ghost is no time.

07:34.413 --> 07:38.375
Very well, but don't forget...
it's first come, first served!

07:45.632 --> 07:47.049
My hips are healed!

07:47.050 --> 07:48.634
That eyelash in my eye is gone!

07:48.635 --> 07:51.220
- My calculus is gone!
- Whoo-hoo! No more hangnail!

07:51.221 --> 07:53.514
Fuck! They're all humans!

07:53.515 --> 07:56.017
Ugh! Leave it to a dumb angel
to come up with a dumb idea.

07:56.018 --> 07:57.226
The fuck did you call me?

07:57.227 --> 08:00.771
My sister and the bitch angel of yours
are just like water and oil.

08:00.772 --> 08:05.735
Water and oil... Yes, water and oil...
They're found in the--

08:05.736 --> 08:07.070
- Yeah! The kitchen!
- Ding ding!

08:07.946 --> 08:08.988
I found it! Oil!

08:08.989 --> 08:10.364
Looks pretty suss.

08:10.365 --> 08:11.617
Let's have a look...

08:15.162 --> 08:17.038
Panty! What the hell was that?

08:17.039 --> 08:19.415
- It's razing.
- It's roaring.

08:19.416 --> 08:21.125
A fire! A fire!

08:21.126 --> 08:22.627
Oh, water! Suspicious water.

08:22.628 --> 08:25.213
C'mon, Geek Boy.
We gotta put out the fire!

08:25.214 --> 08:30.219
- Gimme that water!
- But water on an oil fire will make it--

08:43.732 --> 08:48.152
<i>Water!</i>

08:48.153 --> 08:50.279
Oh my God! I'm fired for sure!

08:50.280 --> 08:52.156
Water and oil. I get it.

08:52.157 --> 08:54.033
There's that ghost.

08:54.034 --> 08:56.369
- Now, let's finish this...
- Wait just a moment!

08:56.370 --> 09:00.039
That ghost is ours.
Who identified its location?

09:00.040 --> 09:01.123
- We did!
- We did!

09:01.124 --> 09:04.335
- Huh?
- I'm the one who noticed the suss kitchen.

09:04.336 --> 09:06.504
Listen up, bitches!

09:06.505 --> 09:09.840
That shitshow right there is two hateful
spirits who got blended by dumbass chance,

09:09.841 --> 09:12.593
sparked a chemical fuckin' reaction
and fused into one ugly motherfucker!

09:12.594 --> 09:16.889
Still beefin' inside like oil and water!

09:16.890 --> 09:18.724
Which means it'll take
both angels and demons...

09:18.725 --> 09:22.311
workin' together to take that fucker down!

09:22.312 --> 09:24.314
- Huh? Why?
- 'Cause I said so!

09:25.524 --> 09:29.986
I hate to say it, but I suppose
we have no choice, Kneesocks.

09:29.987 --> 09:32.531
Yes, it's as you say, Sister.

09:33.365 --> 09:36.200
Whoever gets the coin,
no hard feelings, right?

09:36.201 --> 09:37.911
<i>Gladly. I welcome the challenge!</i>

09:51.466 --> 09:56.470
<i>O, evil spirits born of those
lost between heaven and earth!</i>

09:56.471 --> 10:01.101
<i>May the thunder from the garments
of these holy, tender-skinned maidens...</i>

10:01.685 --> 10:05.938
<i>Break, O Earth. Dry up, O Sea.
Burn out, O Sun.</i>

10:05.939 --> 10:10.193
<i>Grant us the power of the ruler
of this world, the dark lord of Hell!</i>

10:10.777 --> 10:13.612
<i>...shatter your foulness, impurity,
stagnation, and ill will into pieces</i>

10:13.613 --> 10:16.491
<i>and return you to heaven and earth!</i>

10:16.992 --> 10:20.745
<i>We shall banish the evil overflowing
with pride, envy, anger, and pain</i>

10:20.746 --> 10:22.414
<i>back to Hell.</i>

10:34.343 --> 10:36.178
- Repent!
- Repent!

10:36.803 --> 10:38.805
- Return to the dark!
- Return to the dark!

10:49.316 --> 10:51.610
Ethanol!

11:03.789 --> 11:06.791
One Heaven coin. One Hell coin.

11:06.792 --> 11:08.167
Oh man, we get the same amount?

11:08.168 --> 11:10.796
It's all over. I'm definitely fired.

11:11.380 --> 11:15.508
We did only find that ghost because you
accidentally set the place on fire.

11:15.509 --> 11:17.510
Well, look at you go for once, Geek Boy.

11:17.511 --> 11:18.886
You think so?

11:18.887 --> 11:20.471
Hands up! Do not resist!

11:20.472 --> 11:22.556
Are you the ones behind that explosion?

11:22.557 --> 11:23.974
You are, aren't you?

11:23.975 --> 11:25.518
Yes, sir. It was his doing.

11:25.519 --> 11:26.977
He's your arsonist.

11:26.978 --> 11:28.521
What?

11:28.522 --> 11:31.065
All right. Keep it zipped, pyromaniac.

11:31.066 --> 11:33.610
- You have the right to remain silent.
- What?

11:35.195 --> 11:36.488
What's with this smoke?

11:37.489 --> 11:40.449
Damn! I'm feelin' hella baked!
You're totally innocent, my dude.

11:40.450 --> 11:43.954
Yay! I don't know what's happening,
but I'll just... Whoo!

11:45.622 --> 11:47.624
I'm high as a kite, man.

11:51.503 --> 11:54.505
<i>The human heart is all over the joint.</i>

11:54.506 --> 11:57.174
<i>But servants of God,
and minions of the Devil,</i>

11:57.175 --> 12:00.594
<i>they are like water and oil.</i>

12:00.595 --> 12:04.141
<i>Forever and for eternity
will they remain divided.</i>

12:19.030 --> 12:22.408
- Pay! Money!
- Pay up, bitch scum!

12:22.409 --> 12:24.368
Huh? What's this?

12:24.369 --> 12:27.121
There she is! It's that bitch angel!

12:27.122 --> 12:28.707
Throw!

12:31.376 --> 12:34.754
<i>The once peaceful Daten City
has suddenly turned into a sea of fire.</i>

12:35.338 --> 12:36.881
- <i>A huge angel!</i>
- <i>Take a look at this.</i>

12:36.882 --> 12:38.257
<i>She took off her panties!</i>

12:38.258 --> 12:41.218
- <i>Big p***! Big p***!</i>
- <i>Don't look!</i>

12:41.219 --> 12:43.679
<i>A huge commando angel crushed my shop.</i>

12:43.680 --> 12:47.641
<i>Yes, exactly. That bitch angel scum Panty
is the one who destroyed the city.</i>

12:47.642 --> 12:49.101
<i>My sister speaks the truth.</i>

12:49.102 --> 12:53.647
Fuck! Why is this all my fault?
This little bitch had a part to play too.

12:53.648 --> 12:56.359
I have no idea what you're talking about.
I was a demon, remember?

12:56.860 --> 12:59.111
These are the bills
that have been forwarded to you.

12:59.112 --> 13:01.614
That's a total
of three trillion Daten City dollars.

13:01.615 --> 13:03.824
Oh yeah? You've got this, right?

13:03.825 --> 13:05.784
You think I've got that kinda money?

13:05.785 --> 13:10.414
I've still got that damn hold
on my Heavens Express Black card

13:10.415 --> 13:12.124
from buying out your entire wish list!

13:12.125 --> 13:14.252
Huh? Purchase.

13:14.836 --> 13:16.545
Shit! Why won't it let me purchase?

13:16.546 --> 13:18.464
I told you why! My card's on hold!

13:18.465 --> 13:23.469
Well, this sucks. Guess I'll just invite
some guys over for a gang bang then... Huh?

13:23.470 --> 13:25.388
- P-Panty! Look--
- Eww.

13:26.556 --> 13:28.016
- Look at this!
- Huh? What?

13:29.726 --> 13:30.976
I WILL NOT FUCK PANTY

13:30.977 --> 13:33.395
- Fuck, fuck, fuck!
- Oh, shut up.

13:33.396 --> 13:37.107
No parties, no sex...
I may as well be dead!

13:37.108 --> 13:39.194
- I might have an idea.
- Huh?

13:41.821 --> 13:43.322
No way...

13:43.323 --> 13:44.908
You're telling me

13:47.410 --> 13:50.413
there's three trillion dollars
in a nerdy-ass hole like this?

13:51.248 --> 13:55.417
Ow. Um, let's just work here
until we rack up three trillion.

13:55.418 --> 13:56.877
We got enough workers already.

13:56.878 --> 13:58.128
Of course you do...

13:58.129 --> 13:59.464
<i>Welcome.</i>

14:03.635 --> 14:04.803
<i>Welcome.</i>

14:08.056 --> 14:09.431
<i>Welcome.</i>

14:09.432 --> 14:11.226
Let me in!

14:12.561 --> 14:13.937
Oh, my God!

14:14.604 --> 14:17.231
It want me go home.

14:17.232 --> 14:19.150
- Who's this kid?
- <i>Welcome.</i>

14:20.902 --> 14:22.696
Are you okay?

14:23.196 --> 14:25.573
I am Super Guy "Jin."

14:25.574 --> 14:27.617
<i>Domo arigato gozaimasu</i>!

14:28.702 --> 14:30.828
Dang, what an obnoxious little shit.

14:30.829 --> 14:32.413
Come on now.

14:32.414 --> 14:35.709
Holy fucking shit!

14:36.209 --> 14:39.795
T-This is the legendary
ultramega-secret rare card...

14:39.796 --> 14:42.424
Blue Eyes White Uncle!

14:43.592 --> 14:44.967
A white what?

14:44.968 --> 14:46.927
Th-this is a card from
a super competitive trading card game...

14:46.928 --> 14:48.971
It's blowing up with geeks
all over Daten City right now!

14:48.972 --> 14:51.348
It's called "Magic: The Angry Uncle."

14:51.349 --> 14:54.643
It was so overpowered they immediately
pulled it from production in alpha stage!

14:54.644 --> 14:56.520
This card is basically a myth!

14:56.521 --> 14:59.481
This bit of paper?
So it goes for a pretty penny, yeah?

14:59.482 --> 15:01.233
Y-You can't just put a price
on cards like this!

15:01.234 --> 15:03.110
How much for the card?

15:03.111 --> 15:04.862
At the current rate,

15:04.863 --> 15:07.114
it's about three trillion
Daten City dollars.

15:07.115 --> 15:09.283
- Three trillion? Fuck yeah!
- Ow!

15:09.284 --> 15:11.910
Hey, kid. Gimme this card.

15:11.911 --> 15:16.081
No. This card is my heart.
Only duelists can own the card.

15:16.082 --> 15:17.292
Duelist?

15:17.876 --> 15:18.959
Duelist!

15:18.960 --> 15:21.253
Only those who enter the fray
of Magic: The Angry Uncle

15:21.254 --> 15:23.965
have the right to own this card.

15:27.302 --> 15:29.638
Hey, you! Duel with me!

15:30.930 --> 15:32.181
<i>The rules are simple.</i>

15:32.182 --> 15:33.849
<i>With your deck of 60 cards,</i>

15:33.850 --> 15:37.561
<i>you whittle away
your opponent's 20 hit points.</i>

15:37.562 --> 15:41.440
<i>An ultimate battlefield... reserved only
for true warriors worthy of the duel!</i>

15:41.441 --> 15:43.484
<i>And once you reach zero hit points--</i>

15:43.485 --> 15:45.779
- Oh, my god! This is the end.
- You suck!

15:46.446 --> 15:47.946
I play "seppuku!"

15:47.947 --> 15:49.531
Stop, stop!

15:49.532 --> 15:52.493
So, to put two and two together,
pretty much if you lose, you die?

15:52.494 --> 15:57.081
N-No! The loser has to give the winner
one of their cards.

15:57.082 --> 15:59.208
We duelists play by this unspoken rule!

15:59.209 --> 16:01.126
This card is mine.

16:01.127 --> 16:02.920
My heart, gone!

16:02.921 --> 16:04.130
Not so fast.

16:05.048 --> 16:08.133
That three trillion Daten City dollars
is mine.

16:08.134 --> 16:10.844
A card's true value isn't measured
by its price or rarity...

16:10.845 --> 16:13.806
Huh? If the card's got no value,
it's just a damn piece of paper.

16:13.807 --> 16:15.766
I'm afraid I must call you out on that.

16:15.767 --> 16:17.476
Not that card!

16:17.477 --> 16:20.187
Three trillion? Ten trillion?
100 trillion?

16:20.188 --> 16:22.314
It's the most worthless card ever printed!

16:22.315 --> 16:25.484
Mass-produced into oblivion!
We're talking garbage-tier common card!

16:25.485 --> 16:27.403
It's Uncle Knight of Poop!

16:27.404 --> 16:30.115
- Oh, so it's garbage.
- Precisely.

16:30.824 --> 16:32.574
You fools mocked these cards,

16:32.575 --> 16:34.952
called them trash, wiped your filth with
them, and flushed them down the sewers.

16:34.953 --> 16:38.164
But from their rage, their hatred...

16:40.750 --> 16:42.376
- I was born!
- Whoa!

16:42.377 --> 16:46.005
The robed man is actually a g-ghost!

16:48.675 --> 16:50.259
My heart...

